    "text": "Conjecture Let $H$ be a simple $d$-uniform hypergraph, and assume that every set of $d-1$ points is contained in at most $r$ edges. Then there exists an $r+d-1$-edge-coloring so that any two edges which share $d-1$ vertices have distinct colors.",
